<title>USA: Transkaryotic Therapies files for IPO.</title>
<headline>Transkaryotic Therapies files for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transkaryotic Therapies Inc said Tuesday it filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed initial public offering of 2.5 million shares of common stock to be sold by the company.</p>
<p>The price is estimated between $13 and $15 per share.</p>
<p>The offering will be sold through underwriters led by Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, UBS Securities and Pacific Growth Equities Inc.</p>
